# ce-8dc9: donefile's per-board scratch write path (.donefile/scratch/) must stay
# untracked — pruneBoardScratch and boardDirtyCheck are both untracked-only by
# design (ce-a80e), so a scratch body that reaches the index via an out-of-band
# `git add`/`git add -A` is invisible to either, permanently.
.donefile/scratch/
